    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find yourself on a secluded island where nature and time seem to have stopped. There is no rush here - just you, the world around you and endless opportunities for exploration and development. Collect resources, create tools, build structures and solve small tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the secrets of the island and develop your survival skills. There are no enemies here - just you and nature. Enjoy meditative gameplay designed to relax and enthrall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stylized graphics and overhead view</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Calm and relaxing survival without pressure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Varied quests and progression system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Flexible crafting and base expansion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Discovering new territories and secrets of the island</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find yourself on a secluded island where nature and time seem to have stopped. There is no rush here - just you, the world around you and endless opportunities for exploration and development. Collect resources, create tools, build structures and solve small tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the secrets of the island and develop your survival skills. There are no enemies here - just you and nature. Enjoy meditative gameplay designed to relax and enthrall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stylized graphics and overhead view</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Calm and relaxing survival without pressure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Varied quests and progression system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Flexible crafting and base expansion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Discovering new territories and secrets of the island</p>",
    "short_description": "Discover the enchanting world of island survival with an overhead view where exploration, construction and a peaceful atmosphere await you. Expand your territories, complete quests and evolve in this cozy adventure.",
